{
  "description": "The riders built by kiln (assets/models/riders/*.glb) on test/craft/rider_preview.tscn: each rider wears their own body and gear, painted in their own colours (a light grey material a darker shade), with their own build and gear; the boots stand flat while riding; and in every pose (riding, leaning into a turn, thrown, swimming, a handstand) the knees and elbows bend so each limb keeps the length it was built with.",
